_Tetra_ is a simple application created to test my [3D engine](https://github.com/pedroth/Learning/tree/master/src/main/java/windowThreeDim), built from scratch[^1]. It lets you view some *triangular meshes*, including random *planets*, as shown in the videos below.

![Showing some *meshes*](https://youtu.be/EWfagjIxd4g)

![Showing some **planets**](https://youtu.be/SeJcezzg_ow)


Feel free to download the program below.

